\subsection{2.2 Study 1a}

\subsubsection{2.2.1 Participants}

Participants (N = $\Sexpr{dim(ppts_study1a)[1]}$) meeting the eligiblity criteria (aged $\Sexpr{min(ppts_study1a$age)}$-$\Sexpr{max(ppts_study1a$age)}$, consumed >=1 unit of alcohol/average week) were recruited on the panel platform Prolific. For participant characteristics, see Table \ref{tab:DescriptivesTable}.

